 * in the devloop emulator (Mac OS 8.6, 256 MB, the app launched from the
 * "Warlords II" disk, Erythea), at turn 1; they are the same at every
 * launch there.  They are a property of that heap, not of the game, so
 * only FIXED_SEED builds (same-seed comparisons) use them.
